<title>USA: USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 8.</title>
<headline>USDA daily cattle and hog slaughter - July 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>Est daily livestock slaughter under Fed inspection - USDA</p>
<p>					  Cattle	 Calves    Hogs</p>
<p>Tuesday    07/08/97 (est)	 130,000	6,000     319,000</p>
<p>Week ago (est)			128,000	7,000     333,000</p>
<p>Year ago (act)			131,000	9,000     324,000</p>
<p>Week to date (est)		  252,000     12,000     619,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Week (est)     260,000     13,000     635,000</p>
<p>Same Period Last Year (est)     245,000     15,000     628,000</p>
<p>Previous Day Estimated	Steer and Heifer	Cow and Bull</p>
<p>Monday				  109,000		     13,000</p>
<p>USDA revised cattle slaughter for Monday, July 7 to 122,000 from 126,000.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
